                "comment_count": 0,
                "committer": {
                    "date": "2026-07-17T08:50:12Z",
                    "email": "dw-git@d-woods.co.uk",
                    "name": "da-woods"
                },
                "message": "Add a macro to disable detection of PyPy and GraalPy\n\nThe intention here is that it lets them fall through to the\n`Py_LIMITED_API` detection instead. Both of them have expressed\nan ambition to support the Limited API in future so the macro just\nmakes it easier to test and develop this support. If they're\nsuccessful then we'd probably put the Limited API detection first\nrather than relying on the macro. For now it's more likely\nthat `Py_LIMITED_API` is defined unconditionally in people's\nbuild scripts and it isn't intended on PyPy and Graal so the\ndetection order should remain the same.",
                "tree": {
                    "sha": "7c871bc0925fd691f909774e8cc67fa4b465dd1b",
